 9168:2012 is crucial for optimizing water use in Lúa.", source_file:"So_tay_ky_thuat_canh_tac_cay_lua_1785658290.md (ID: So_tay_ky_thuat_canh_tac_cay_lua_1785658290)", chunk_id:"chunk_34"}}, {start: {id:"QCVN 01-54:2011/BNNPTNT"}, end: {id:"Lúa"}, properties:{file_id:"So_tay_ky_thuat_canh_tac_cay_lua_1785658290", file_ids:["So_tay_ky_thuat_canh_tac_cay_lua_1785658290"], description:"The national standards for seed quality in QCVN 01-54:2011/BNNPTNT are vital for ensuring the quality of Lúa seeds.", source_file:"So_tay_ky_thuat_canh_tac_cay_lua_1785658290.md (ID: So_tay_ky_thuat_canh_tac_cay_lua_1785658290)", chunk_id:"chunk_34"}}, {start: {id:"Cục Trồng Trọt"}, end: {id:"Lúa"}, properties:{file_id:"so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260", file_ids:["so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260"], description:"Cục Trồng trọt oversees the production of Lúa, ensuring quality and sustainability.", source_file:"so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260.md (ID: so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260)", chunk_id:"chunk_2"}}, {start: {id:"Hợp Tác Xã"}, end: {id:"Lúa"}, properties:{file_id:"so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260", file_ids:["so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260"], description:"Hợp tác xã requires the cultivation of Lúa for its agricultural activities.", source_file:"so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260.md (ID: so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260)", chunk_id:"chunk_6"}}, {start: {id:"Doanh Nghiệp"}, end: {id:"Lúa"}, properties:{file_id:"so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260", file_ids:["so-tay-huong-dan-quy-trinh-1-trieu-ha-dbscl-ngay-27-3-2024_1785660260"], description:"Doanh nghiệp requires the cultivation of Lúa to support its business operations.", source_file:"so-tay-huong-dan-quy